        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "暑い日には、冷たい炭酸を飲むのが一番だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この炭酸は、レモン風味が爽やかで美味しい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "お酒を割るのに、無糖の炭酸を使うことが多い。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
